1774:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Complementary channels, break features and dead time.
1775:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure Master synchronization.
1776:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****       (+) Configure timer remapping capabilities.
