1783:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c **** /**
1784:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @brief  Configure the TIM commutation event sequence.
1785:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   * @note  This function is mandatory to use the commutation event in order to
1786:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        update the configuration at each commutation detection on the TRGI input of the Timer,
1787:Drivers/STM32F7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f7xx_hal_tim_ex.c ****   *        the typical use of this feature is with the use of another Timer(interface Timer)
